{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260611100004","title":"Comprehension Debt","desc":"Kesenjangan antara kecepatan produksi kode AI dan kecepatan pemahaman manusia.","updated":1781149252391,"created":1781149252353,"tags":["zettel","ai-agents","loop-engineering"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260611100004","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"083bee9455d445851219def172e98f13","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260611100004","id":"zettel.20260611100004","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260611100004","id":"zettel.20260611100004","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai-agents","alias":"ai-agents","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai-agents"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260611100004","id":"zettel.20260611100004","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.loop-engineering","alias":"loop-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.loop-engineering"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260611100004","id":"zettel.20260611100004","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.moc.ai-agents","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":9,"offset":541},"end":{"line":10,"column":33,"offset":565},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.moc.ai-agents"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260611100004","id":"zettel.20260611100004","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.ai-agents.loop-engineering","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":35,"offset":567},"end":{"line":10,"column":71,"offset":603},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.ai-agents.loop-engineering"}}],"anchors":{"comprehension-debt":{"type":"header","text":"Comprehension Debt","value":"comprehension-debt","line":12,"column":0,"depth":1}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"comprehension-debt\">Comprehension Debt<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#comprehension-debt\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"comprehension-debt-1\">Comprehension Debt<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#comprehension-debt-1\"></a></h1>\n<p>Comprehension Debt adalah kondisi di mana volume kode yang dihasilkan oleh AI agent melampaui kapasitas manusia untuk memahami, memverifikasi, dan memiliki (<em>ownership</em>) atas kode tersebut.</p>\n<p><strong>Risiko</strong>: Terjadinya <em>cognitive surrender</em>, di mana engineer berhenti memberikan penilaian kritis dan menerima hasil AI hanya karena \"test-nya hijau\".</p>\n<p><strong>Mitigasi</strong>: Diperlukan \"Comprehension Engineering\"—ritual review yang sengaja didesain untuk memaksa manusia memahami perubahan, bukan sekadar menyetujui output.</p>\n<p>Relasi: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.ai-agents\">AI Agents Map of Content</a>, <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.ai-agents.loop-engineering\">Loop Engineering: From Prompting to System Design</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai-agents (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">loop-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersi